tered from your registered email address.

Next Steps for Your Account Security
Although we previously completed a Zoom callback to restore your account ac=
cess, your report of ongoing, unexpected email verification codes changes o=
ur assessment of your account's safety. This strongly suggests that your re=
gistered email address has been compromised through means falling outside t=
he PDAX platform. Such unauthorized access paved the way for the accessor t=
o log-in to your PDAX account.
Rest assured that we are monitoring this closely and we will update you on =
any further developments. We strongly encourage you to coordinate with the =
National Bureau of Investigation (=E2=80=9CNBI=E2=80=9D) Cybercrime Divisio=
n or the Philippine National Police Anti-Cybercrime Group, which are the pr=
oper authorities to handle cybercrime enforcement and technical investigati=
ons pursuant to the Cybercrime Prevention Act of 2012. A formal investigati=
on by these enforcement agencies may be warranted to accurately determine t=
he nature and extent of the incident.=C2=A0
